# EmberBSD (AI-assisted): Chromium 156 rvalue DictValue::Set delegates to
# the lvalue overload carrying this patch; its former conversion is superseded.
Chromium/Electron: preserve the additional NetBSD and explicit cross-build changes.

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), derived from e12-cross-adaptations.patch at
Ports46f7a64c and rebased on the committed Electron/BSD source preparation.
BSD support and its license remain owned by the pinned chromium-nb overlay.
This layer omits duplicate overlay files, downloaded tools, fabricated pkg-config
metadata and obsolete Apple Clang diagnostic workarounds. Native tool selection
is completed by the following patches in source-series.json.

